<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53055" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰνᾰχ-ή</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-Χά,</span></b> 
		ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κανάσσω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sharp sound</i>; esp.
			<i>ring</i> or <i>clang</i> of metal, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεινὴν . . πήληξ βαλλομένη καναχὴν ἔχε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.105
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				794
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. δ᾽ ἦν ἡμιόνοιιν</span>
			<i>loud</i> rang their <i>tramp</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				6.82
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀδόντων μὲν κ. πέλε</span>
			<i>gnashing</i> of teeth, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				19.365
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				164
			</span></i>: pl., ib. <i><span class="en">
				160
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ</span>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χαλκ</span>]<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όκτυπος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
				13.15
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χρυσοῦ κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				130
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. αὐλῶν</span>
			<i>sound</i> of flutes, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				10.39
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				B.
				2.12
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				642
			</span></i> (lyr.); ofthelyre, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ap.</u>
				185
			</span></i>.</div>
